Air traffic simulation panel

USAGE
    ./my_radar [.rdr file]
    this program take exactly one argument,
    witch is the .rdr file to read or an option

OPTIONS
    -h, --help
        Display this help

    -l, --legend
        Display more information about the .rdr file

ADDITIONAL CONTENT
    The project contains a .rdr file that can be used to test the program.
    the format of the file is quite complex, refer to README.legend for more information.
